 "title": "Why English Spelling Makes No Sense #shorts",
 "description": "Mispronunciation videos are everywhere, but it's not the speakers' fault. Knight, ghost, debt and island all got their odd spellings by accident, or by showing off.\n\nFollow for what's trending, explained!\n\n#english #language #etymology #spelling #shorts",
